_il["intro"]="<b>Israelis are voting today, Tuesday, October 27.</b> Polls are open from 7 a.m. to 10 p.m. Israel time (05:00 to 20:00 GMT, 1 a.m. to 4 p.m. ET), with TV exit polls as soon as they close. There are 7,331,981 eligible voters, 12,018 polling stations and 36 party lists, Ynet reports. Official results are due by November 4. "+_il["intro"].replace("Israel votes on Tuesday, October 27, 2026,","Israel votes on Tuesday, October 27, 2026,")
