_il["body"]='''<h2>Election day, the basics</h2><p>Exit polls are projections, not results, and the count of double-envelope ballots (soldiers, diplomats and others) can shift seats in the days after. It's the first national election since October 7, 2023, the Jerusalem Post notes. Small parties near the 3.25% threshold matter a lot: the Taub Center estimates about 165,635 votes are needed to cross it at 70% turnout, per the Post.</p>'''+_il["body"]
